Hungarian algorithm (cp-algorithms)
-----------------------------------

The solver of the linear assignment problems of gt_clumppling()
(clumppling_lsap() in src/clumppling_assignment.cpp) is adapted from the
O(n^3) implementation of the Hungarian algorithm "developed by Andrey
Lopatin", given in the article "Hungarian algorithm for solving the
assignment problem" of cp-algorithms
(https://cp-algorithms.com/graph/hungarian-algorithm.html, translated from
e-maxx.ru, https://e-maxx.ru/algo/assignment_hungary), with the changes
listed in that file. The content of cp-algorithms is Copyright (c)
2014-2025 by cp-algorithms contributors, and is licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode). Creative Commons
lists the GNU GPL version 3 as a compatible licence for adaptations of
CC BY-SA 4.0 material (https://creativecommons.org/compatiblelicenses), so
the adapted code is distributed under the GNU GPL version 3, with this
notice. The material is provided as is, without warranties, as stated in
