splitmix64
----------

The hash that assigns genotypes to the folds of the cross-validation of
gt_radmix() (fold() in src/radmix_geno_access.h) uses the finaliser of
splitmix64 (Steele, Lea and Flood 2014), with the shifts and multipliers of
the implementation by Sebastiano Vigna (https://prng.di.unimi.it/splitmix64.c),
which its author has dedicated to the public domain (CC0 1.0).
